### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Add your own requests here for the rules in ASSIGNMENT.md
# Run the requests in order, top to bottom.
# Data is stored in SQLite and survives restarts: to start from a clean state,
# stop the app and delete src/RoomHub.Api/roomhub.db before running the file again.

### R8. Cancel an already cancelled booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### R8. Cancel a missing booking (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### R8. A cancelled booking frees its interval (same interval as request 4, expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "carla",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R7. Touching interval: starts exactly when the previous one ends (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "dan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R7. Touching interval: ends exactly when the previous one starts (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "dan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T09:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R1. Room with an empty name (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "capacity": 10
}

### R1. Room with capacity 0 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room X",
  "capacity": 0
}

### Booking in a missing room, with an invalid body (expected: 404, not 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T09:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 0
}

### R2. Missing bookedBy (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R3. End equal to start (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R4. Zero attendees (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 0
}

### R4. More attendees than the room capacity (capacity is 10, expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### R5. Booking that starts in the past (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2020-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-03-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R6. Longer than 4 hours (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T14:00:01Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R6. Exactly 4 hours is allowed (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "emil",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### New requirement: max 2 active bookings per participant per UTC day, across all rooms
# Create a second room
# @name createRoom2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 2",
  "capacity": 6
}

###
@room2Id = {{createRoom2.response.body.$.id}}

### Daily limit: 1st booking of "maria" on 2030-04-01, room 1 (expected: 201)
# @name mariaFirst
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T09:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

###
@mariaFirstId = {{mariaFirst.response.body.$.id}}

### Daily limit: 2nd booking of "maria" on 2030-04-01, room 2 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{room2Id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### Daily limit: 3rd booking of "maria" on the same day (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T14:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T15:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### Daily limit: the day is the UTC date of startUtc, a booking ending on the next day still counts (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{room2Id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T23:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-02T01:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### Daily limit: another participant on the same day is not affected (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ion",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T14:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T15:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### Daily limit: "maria" on a different day is not affected (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-02T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-02T09:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### Daily limit: cancel the 1st booking of "maria" (expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{mariaFirstId}}/cancel

### Daily limit: cancelled bookings do not count, a new one on 2030-04-01 is accepted (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{room2Id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "maria",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T16:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T17:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}
